      "safetyNotes": "No physical hazards. The road-safety tree diagram discusses pedestrian near-miss data; the teacher should handle this sensitively, because some learners may have personal experience of road accidents. Frame discussion around civic awareness and data, not personal tragedy. The numbers in the scenario are made up for practice and are not real statistics."
