        "teacherMoves": "Say: 'Today you design a game for a school fete, give it to another group, play it, and check whether it is fair. First, a quick prediction.' Display the game card. Allow 2 minutes of silent writing. Cold-call 2 learners (one YES, one NO) and record their reasons in a 'Prediction Bank' on the board. Do NOT confirm or correct. Say: 'You will check this with a sample space in the Explain phase.'",
